_650ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)_var(--reveal-delay,_1050ms)] motion-reduce:[&_*]:[transition:none]! motion-reduce:[&[data-contact-view='message']_*]:[transition:none]!" data-contact-view="details">
